{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>הפעם הא'</b><br>שחרחרת. The doubling comes to diminish, not to add, like אדמדמת, which is a little red." "ששזפתני. The first shin is in place of אשר, like שבשפלנו זכר לנו, and its meaning is גילתני [revealed me] — not the שזפתו עין איה [the staring of a hawk's eye]." "נחרו בי. The nun is added to the nifal pattern, like נלחמו בי, from the root לחרחר ריב, like ויחר אפו." "נוטרה. Guarding [fem.], a descriptive noun." "<b>הפעם הג'</b><br>ששזפתני השמש — this is the exile, and its cause: בני אמי נחרו בי — for in Egypt there were many idolaters, and so Ezekiel said: ואודע להם בארץ מצרים, and he said to them: איש גלולי עיניו השליכו etc., and they rebelled against YHWH, but afterward they repented, as וישמע אלהים את נאקתם. And this is הגידה לי עיקר מצותיך — that You are the shepherd, and I will not intermingle with the Egyptians."], :book :song-of-songs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {0 "The text opens with a lemma from the verse; 'הפעם הא׳' appears to be a section marker indicating 'this first time/occurrence.'", 1 "Resolved the parenthetical bet as marking 'in place of,' following the sense of the comparison.", 2 "The bracketed וכמהו is rendered as part of the comparison chain; bracket appears in source.", 4 "The bracketed השליכו appears in source; the citation is from Ezekiel 20:7. The identity of הגידה לי as a verse quotation is uncertain; rendered as integral to the argument."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra's commentary on the Canticles" "http://beta.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH002030344/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:43:52.083838755Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}